{"source":"github","project_id":"backports","target":"r-lib/backports","id":"pr/70","ref":70,"title":"Add some of the Rconcordance functions from R 4.3.0 ","description":"This PR adds some of the functions from the current R-devel to backports.  I'm submitting it more for comments than as a final version. \r\n\r\nI am currently working on a package (https://github.com/dmurdoch/RmdConcord) which would make use of these functions, and I plan to propose some changes to `knitr` and `roxygen2` that would also need these functions (and maybe others).  At this point I'd mostly like to know whether the PR is in an acceptable format or not.  ","published_at":"2022-11-23T21:30:53Z","updated_at":"2023-03-07T11:12:04Z","url":"https://github.com/r-lib/backports/pull/70","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"dmurdoch","state":"CLOSED"}}
